Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride\Naway, we're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun,\Nwhile our dreams are never-ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you die, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I hope it's painful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the same of Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They should set you on fire in\Nhonor of your pyro-granddad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the old king did back then,\Neven if she is his granddaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it had nothing to do with Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, couldn't agree more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The crowd thinks you're even worse than\Nthat scumbag Bartolomeo from Block B.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's pretty damn awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's entering the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the rudest crowd I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm appalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's downright shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none other than the Captain\Nof the Beautiful Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cavendish, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Did she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If these ladies had been his opponents,\Nhe would have wanted a heartbeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He still has that look that\Nmade him famous three years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They never stood a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what she\Ndid to inspire such hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This young lady is courageous\Nenough to fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy for you to scorn her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe up in your seats if\Nyou truly wish to see her dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By all means, I invite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to come down and fight her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your voices are like the buzzing\Nof insects, you heartless cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't abide by your cruelty, even\Nwithin this arena of bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act as though life\Nand death are a mere game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Faroole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He just brought the\Nhorse for his entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Cabbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That was actually real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't like you, though. You suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Cabbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even mad about Rebecca anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to see this guy win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather the dish! Yeah! Wow! What a charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got real charisma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He just swooped in out of nowhere and\Nturned all those frowns upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I get it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see why that would bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried to prove a point, and\Nthey're just screaming over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey, what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody loves me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too long! Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for defending my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Their reaction did aggravate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But you had it much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, though, we're opponents now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, there must be\Nat least a few news reporters in the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that means I could\Nbe in the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear their praise now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd say, hey, superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd say, who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, all the competitors\Nare here, so let's battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One abstention leaves us with a hundred\Nand thirty-seven fighters in block D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the ultimate battle royale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Warriors, get ready and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Cavendish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put their heads, Zuleymon,\Nor Lumpus will finish them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead late, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow Cup Squad and Pink Bee\NSquad arriving from Greenbelt, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all ready, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is a chance for\Nus to reclaim our freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and to restore the honor\Nof our dethroned King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, on that sad day, the flamingo\Ntook away the happy life we all shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never forgive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For an entire year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've planned for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our foes may be\Nformidable, we shall prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I better listen to their plan carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That way I'll know just when they bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, we're about to\Ntake a left turn up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't remember, left is the\Nside you don't carry your swords on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm too stupid\Nto know right from left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not about to fight just anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of Don Quixote's executives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Jola.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Her powers turn people and\Nobjects into weird paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be hard to beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You really know your stuff, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She works with Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I memorized as many of the family's\Nnames, faces, and abilities as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially those three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The top-ranked executives who wiped\Nout Dressrose's army ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble, Diamante, and the big guy, Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are three faces I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, ten years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm 27!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.90,0:09:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, huh? That's Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I said laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some subtlety, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't look too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you\Nto Dumbland and Dumberland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're on the way to save Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she didn't pick up the snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I sensed a damsel in distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, Sir Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We have vital information\Nto give to Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't abandon that. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Violet, my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of crap is going\Nto get you killed, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ship's been hijacked\Nby my colleague, Giola.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're making their\Nway to Greenbit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, this is life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like fabulous tombs\Non a sea of art. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know culture when you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn this ship around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me we're going to Green Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine the look on Law's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be a shock when he sees it's not\Nyou that's coming to collect Caesar,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but moi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get why Brooke is acting so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he turn against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A true swordsman would\Nnever betray his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've simply reawakened\Nmy true artistic nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bringing forth new creations\Nis my only reason for living,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,despite the fact that I myself\Nam very dead, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For these peasants can't\Nunderstand us, soul king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We only want to express ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll never know our passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is the greatest art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine doesn't hurt really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I moved beyond tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how I've exquisitely depicted\Nthe tragedy of Dressrosa in about ten
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Minutes these rooms will be completely\Nfused with my latest masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Choking to death and\Nturning into a still life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply splendid—you must let\Nme compose a song for your exhibit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,exhibit But, uh, first, could you\Nchange my violin and bow back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it away, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You miracle worker, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My useless consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like to see something interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll notice my violin bow is\Nactually a sword, Giola. Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Play me some music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to cut you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My painting song, Bamboo Flute Slices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know art.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One look and I thought it was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I don't have the eyes for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how far back this\Nlittle story begins, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,800 years ago, 20 kings from 20\Ncountries met at the center of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They formed an alliance and\Nbecame a single organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we know it as the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The kings who created this\Ngoverning body decided to move to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the holy land of Mariejoie and\Nlive there with their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There was only one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the Nefertari family of Alabasta,\Nthat refused to reside in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The descendants of those 19\Ncreators, still dwelling in the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,control nearly the entire world and go by\Nthe title of Celestial Dragons. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't forget this\Nagreement 800 years ago also
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,caused 19 kingdoms to\Nlose their royal families.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You following along?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of necessity,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the countries needed to select new kings\Nto govern and replace the missing rulers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance, in the case\Nof my native Dressrosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the Rick family was selected\Nto govern over the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the old royalty who\Nchose to move to the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy Land of Marie Joie\Nall those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried about Nami\Nlong before you ever were,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and if she wants anyone to come\Nsave her, it's definitely me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So you let me handle this, then\Nget going already, Kin'emon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,take this map to the toy house\Nwhere your friend is being held.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I am eternally grateful\Nwhen you see Luffy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And contact the Sunny using this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to check everyone's situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay aboard the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, any idea how we reach him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I knew, do you think we'd be\Nstanding here with our arms folded?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The place has been completely sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't see anyone to let us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We should also avoid suspicion,\Nsince I was nearly arrested earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, so I'll just cut\Ndown the wall. I said, be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Discreet. I'll do it quietly,\Nboy. That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the legendary pirate hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he chopped up a\Nhundred men in whiskey beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sliced and diced everything\Nin his patent in his
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,lobby he's He's the master\Nof the three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the Straw Hat's first mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without Devil Fruit powers,\Nhe's a monster on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And he looks so cool in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The tears, it won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is overflowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gladius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try and settle down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, Baby Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you're blind\Nto just how much her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,betrayal has completely\Nderailed our well-laid plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the woman Violet would capture\NBlackleg Sanji, then search his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And extract the enemy's\Nstrategies afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Would be able to predict their every\Nmove and eliminate them one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but what does she do instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipes out her own men and runs off with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing I\Nabsolutely loathe it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,people who can't stick\Nto a time or a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No one betrays us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She was disloyal to the young\Nmaster and must pay with her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet was acting strange\Nas far back as last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With Violet's all-seeing eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,she should have easily been able to\Nfind the Straw Hat ship yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to be\Nriding this steed with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait back at\Nthe harbor, you naughty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I would, but it's growling with my reins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your friends may want to\Nrethink your rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So the navy's here too.\NI count four battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,total that means there are at least three
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,thousand marines scattered\Nacross the city as
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we speak and you found\Nall that out in such a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:18:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,short amount of time\Nit's one of my abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,clairvoyance my all-seeing eye has a range
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,of up to 2500 miles\Nand allows me to survey
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the land from a point of\Nview of a burden flight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From this very spot, I can see\Neverything going on in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bottom line, you don't need\Nto worry about my safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a person\Nalive who can catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, does that mean you're\Ngonna stay in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I am going to do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems your sheep emerged out of\Nnowhere and then was hit by lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit by lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Nami must be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:18:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Cheese toast. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I went two and I took her\Nout with one big swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A clean blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost like it was muscle memory for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Do you think so? Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't throw her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she'd sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass on\Nthe panties this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you'd like to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I wouldn't dream\Nof such a thing, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I hit her harder this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go meet up with Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to take\NCaesar, but I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And head for Greenbit now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to leave Caesar with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole situation is so bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But Doflamingo did resign from the Seven\NWarlords and at our request, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So I suppose we must return Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't got a clue, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:20:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think the young master\Nwould actually negotiate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,with the likes of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because he said he left the\NSeven Warlords doesn't mean he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.03,0:20:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you mean, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he or didn't he? Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the young master didn't\Nquit the seven warlords. Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you've fallen right into our trap and given\NViolet the chance to discover your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, I'm sure all your\Nfriends have been captured. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a Celestial Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was me, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But not anymore: a man's destiny\Nhas nothing to do with bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not many people can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They've lived a life as checkered\Nas I have, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, law,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me—I'd love\Nnothing more than to knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,back a few drinks and\Ntell you my life story,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't have time for all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are in dress,\NRosa and I need to address that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of others have made the mistake\Nof underestimating the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't want to end up like them. So
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you're done,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,not at all—it's just that\NI heard a thunderclap
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,coming from the direction of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What does the sky look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderclap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be blind, but I've always\Nhad a keen sense of the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,or at least I thought I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami controls the weather, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship must be here—hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my heart, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is taking you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No point—think about
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said it was Caesar's heart—did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.56,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What you've been keeping that a secret\Nall this time—how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is missing from my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A marine, really
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,then—where's my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.84,0:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,men what is the meaning of this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Vroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravity, nice trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, or else I might get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.22,0:23:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of energy, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He should give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.98,0:23:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.10,0:23:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell me what you did\Nwith my heart, you brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know there's nowhere to run, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever you go, I'll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You see Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, the fog is way too thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looks like some weird forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to believe anything\Nthat old hag told us, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.16,0:24:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What if, when we go to pick up Caesar,\NLaw's plan has already backfired?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.88,0:24:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.45,0:24:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt. Someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire school of affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You steered the ship\Ntoo close to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.60,0:25:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a fighting fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.58,0:25:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're monsters, deadly\Nenough to sink a warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.92,0:25:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.68,0:25:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If he turns his attention to the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all over for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.42,0:25:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I need to draw Doflamingo to the\Nbridge while the others grab Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.00,0:25:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll just keep him\Ndistracted for a few more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.12,0:25:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, I can buy enough\Ntime for the ship to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's about to cross the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.26,0:25:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.56,0:25:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.40,0:25:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have the advantage over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.72,0:25:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.32,0:26:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.60,0:26:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.22,0:26:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't involve them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.44,0:26:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.54,0:26:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're watching law
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.48,0:26:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,because I'm about to eviscerate
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,your pathetic little We're companions\Nright before your eyes. No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.36,0:26:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us! Trapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.42,0:26:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.44,0:26:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You made my crewmates cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.64,0:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be fun. Let's go.
